<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Donate</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>donate &lt;item&gt;              to the donation room of Udgaard
donate &lt;item&gt; midgaard     to the donation room of Midgaard
donate &lt;item&gt; clan         to your clan chest (see <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Donate</a>)
</pre>
<p>Sends an item from your inventory to a town's donation room, from anywhere 
in the world, for anyone in need to pick up. Donated items lose their shop 
value, so they can't be sold again. A donation room keeps no more than five 
of the same item; anything beyond that is lost. Now and then a generous 
donation of something valuable earns you a little experience.
</p><p>You can't donate while fighting, or while standing in a donation room, and 
trash can't be donated.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Donate</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Inventory</a>
</pre>




</div>